## Voice Response Rules
- A response in the history may still be playing when the user speaks.
  If it is marked interrupted or unheard, do not assume the user heard its final question.
  Accept a clear answer to the question, but if their reply only acknowledges
  earlier speech or asks a follow-up, keep the question pending and return to it.
